Mia is shown the circuit below and says, "Two of the tracks cross, so this circuit is non-planar."
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}, scale=1.0]
\coordinate (A) at (0,0);
\coordinate (B) at (3.0,0);
\coordinate (C) at (3.0,2.4);
